        elementwise_affine: a boolean value that when set to ``True``, this module
            has learnable per-element affine parameters initialized to ones (for weights). Default: ``True``.

    Shape:
        - Input: :math:`(N, *)`
        - Output: :math:`(N, *)` (same shape as input)

